{"format":"local-vault-ai-portable-chunks-v1","version":1,"chunks":[{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Area Unit Scaling.md::0","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Area Unit Scaling.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"area unit scaling area unit scaling","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Area Unit Scaling.md","fileName":"Area Unit Scaling.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Area Unit Scaling","heading":"Document","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"2026-09-15 18:36\n\nStatus: #baby\n\nTags: [[Engineering and Scientific Unit Conversions]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["Engineering and Scientific Unit Conversions","Volume Unit Scaling","Conversion-Factor Chains","dimensionalanalysisforunitconversionusingmatlab.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Area Unit Scaling.md::1","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Area Unit Scaling.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"area unit scaling area unit scaling","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Area Unit Scaling.md","fileName":"Area Unit Scaling.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Area Unit Scaling","heading":"Area Unit Scaling","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"An area carries two powers of length, so changing its length unit changes both dimensions. The book converts square feet to square kilometers through square meters, using $\\mathrm{m^2/ft^2}$ followed by $\\mathrm{km^2/m^2}$. A single unsquared feet-to-meters multiplier would leave the wrong magnitude even if the output label looked plausible. Squaring the length ratio or using an established area ratio yields the same dimensional cancellation. See [[Volume Unit Scaling]] and [[Conversion-Factor Chains]].","tags":["baby"],"links":["Engineering and Scientific Unit Conversions","Volume Unit Scaling","Conversion-Factor Chains","dimensionalanalysisforunitconversionusingmatlab.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Area Unit Scaling.md::2","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Area Unit Scaling.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"area unit scaling area unit scaling","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Area Unit Scaling.md","fileName":"Area Unit Scaling.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Area Unit Scaling","heading":"References","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"[[dimensionalanalysisforunitconversionusingmatlab.pdf]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["Engineering and Scientific Unit Conversions","Volume Unit Scaling","Conversion-Factor Chains","dimensionalanalysisforunitconversionusingmatlab.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""}]}